<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="10">
<name>Body &amp; Electrical</name>
<section id="1002S_S000E" variety="S000E">
<name>Vehicle Surroundings Monitor</name>
<ttl id="1002S_S000E_746W2_T00DG" variety="T00DG">
<name>Back Guide Monitor System</name>
<para id="RM000000OCQ05NX" category="D" type-id="303F4" name-id="672R7-16" from="200912">
<name>DTC Check/Clear</name>
<subpara id="RM000000OCQ05NX_z0" proc-id="RM0550J___0000HXU00000">
<content5 releasenbr="2">
<step1>
<ptxt>Read DTC (Read Using TaSCAN)</ptxt>
<step2>
<ptxt>Turn IG OFF.</ptxt>
</step2>
<step2>
<ptxt>Connect SST (TaSCAN) to DLC3.</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70201</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
</step2>
<step2>
<ptxt>Start the engine, select "Diagnosis" → "Vehicle Diagnosis/All DTCs" or "System Diagnosis/Body" → "System Name/Navigation System" → "DTC" on the SST (TaSCAN) screen to display the DTC check screen.</ptxt>
</step2>
<step2>
<ptxt>Check the diagnostic trouble codes.</ptxt>
<atten3>
<ptxt>Always check DTCs with the engine running.</ptxt>
</atten3>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>If a malfunction code is displayed, refer to the DTC Chart (<xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000002O403WX"/>).</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>The navigation receiver assembly outputs DTCs for the following systems. If a DTC not listed in Back Guide Monitor System - Diagnostic Trouble Code Chart is output, refer to the other systems.</ptxt>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.01in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>System Name</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Reference</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>HDD Navigation System</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>
<xref label="Seep02" href="RM0000002RS05SX"/>
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>ETC System</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>
<xref label="Seep04" href="RM000001US9017X"/>
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>After repair, check the DTCs again and confirm that no malfunction code is output.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</step2>
</step1>
<step1>
<ptxt>Clear DTC Memory (Clear Using TaSCAN)</ptxt>
<step2>
<ptxt>Turn IG OFF.</ptxt>
</step2>
<step2>
<ptxt>Connect SST (TaSCAN) to DLC3.</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70201</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
</step2>
<step2>
<ptxt>Start the engine, select "Diagnosis" → "Vehicle Diagnosis/All DTCs" or "System Diagnosis/Body" → "System Name/Navigation System" → "DTC" on the SST (TaSCAN) screen to display the DTC check screen.</ptxt>
</step2>
<step2>
<ptxt>Select "Clear" and clear the DTCs following the screen instructions.</ptxt>
</step2>
</step1>
</content5>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
</tmc-service-inc>